{"answer": "The event-router was deleted on 2026-10-02, in an amendment to ADR-044 that folded it into lore-api. GitHub webhooks now go to lore-api's `POST /api/webhook/github`. That route verifies the HMAC signature (secret `LORE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`) and writes events to `pipeline.events` on lore-api's own pool. The public `/api/events` URL still works: the ingresses rewrite it onto that route, so no repository hook had to be repointed.", "sources": ["adrs/ADR-044-event-router-owns-the-event-bus.md (Amendment 2026-10-02)", "specs/api-routes/webhook-github/spec.md"]}
```

